  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Wonderful (the way i feel**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Touch Me I'm Going To Scream ( pt 2 )**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Carnival**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2010-05-02.Flac** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 135 min [1]. Said about its sound: The storm's thunder and high winds can be heard on the recording, though the uploader still finds it very good; Audience recording; people singing nearby can be heard in the background, which holds the sound back a little [1][2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Preservation Hall Jazz Band joined My Morning Jacket for this show [1]\n- A storm moved through first, with thunder, and then high winds [1]\n- Preservation Hall Jazz Band played with the group during the encore [2]\n- Reviewer ranks it with a 2012 show, as both featured Preservation Hall Jazz Band [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2010-05-02.Flac**: taped by Jim Mal; transferred by Jim Mal; source: Audience > Berliner cm33's > pmd 661 ( Oade Mod ) [1]",
